<title>FRANCE: France Telecom says no D Telekom stake now.</title>
<headline>France Telecom says no D Telekom stake now.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>French state-owned telecom operator France Telecom said that it intended to have a cross shareholding with Germany's Deutsche Telekom but this was not possible at the moment.</p>
<p>&quot;The chairmen of the two companies have always said that such a shareholding was only possible after the two companies had a share listing,&quot; a France Telecom spokesman said on Monday.</p>
<p>Deutsche Telekom shares start trading today while France Telecom is slated for a partial privatisation in April. The head of France Telekom Spain reiterated to the El Mundo newspaper on Sunday that the two companies planned cross stakes.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +331 4221 5452</p>
</text>
